    {
      "id": "claim_9a0863aa6da74d37aca9c8a110ea96e0",
      "statement": "Raster PNG icons at 192x192 and 512x512 are required because Samsung Internet will not install the app without them; pwa.test.ts validates them by checking PNG magic bytes and decoding the IHDR width/height at offsets 16 and 20, so a mis-sized or corrupt icon fails the suite.",
