      "id": "claim_f99d944853f14d0eab6462d9ff1d449c",
      "statement": "One asset /pwa-icon.svg is simultaneously the browser tab favicon (link rel=\"icon\" in index.html), a manifest icon, and the 48×48 in-app brand mark rendered by BrandHeader, while apple-touch-icon points at the rasterized /pwa-icon-192.png — keeping installed icon, tab icon, and header mark identical by construction, asserted in BrandHeader.test.tsx.",
