    {
      "id": "claim_83be5043ab344b7b85b5f01f0f852cdb",
      "statement": "The worker and registration script have no exports, so the tests execute them as data: register-sw.js runs in node:vm.runInNewContext with a stubbed navigator.serviceWorker.register and a capturing window.addEventListener (asserting register was called with exactly \"/sw.js?v=6\" on the load event), and sw.js runs in a fresh VM with a stubbed self recording addEventListener, asserting exactly [\"install\", \"activate\", \"fetch\"].",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/web/src/pwa.test.ts#L124-L137",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f2bc7742816e6e556ffaf961c249a673ae169d0ea10c008d2708e4ecf59e65e5:"
