    {
      "id": "claim_06dcb05238784cc98c11602f3d306b8b",
      "statement": "The worker is hand-written with no Workbox, precache generator, or build-time plugin: apps/web/public/sw.js is copied verbatim by Vite into the build output (byte-identical to the emitted dist/sw.js), and its offline guarantee covers only the shell, not application data.",
