    {
      "id": "claim_4abcac97df2047acba2decd7fadf4311",
      "statement": "The single cached root document is a correct offline fallback because the SPA has no client-side routing: it is one view whose durable state is anonymous localStorage under the key mota:transit-selections:v1 rather than in the URL; introducing a router would invalidate the cache-only-\"/\" assumption in the navigation branch.",
